Downstream Output:
  - TEXT: Corrected complete main text
Consumption Chain Priority:
  P0 = prev_hook_unfulfilled / hook_missing / hook_too_weak
  P1 = payoff_missing / outline_mismatch / verified style voice preservation
  P2 = word count boundaries
================================================================================
